From: TheDBP <TheDBP@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 14:22:31 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] SetupWizard: preselect 3-button navigation

The navigation page defaults to gestures, which draws a pill and never shows the nav-bar icons this
image ships. Preselect 3-button; gestures stay one tap away.

Retargeted for the 24.0 layout rewrite. Upstream replaced the RadioGroup with a
MaterialButtonToggleGroup (SUW: Revamp NavigationSettings to ToggleGroups, then Re-write ThemeSettings
and Navigation Layout, then Re-format resources via AndroidStudio), so the old approach of moving
android:checked between two RadioButtons no longer exists. The group declares its default once, in
app:checkedButton, which is the single line to change.

The Kotlin default is unchanged from the previous version: `selection` still initialises to
NAV_BAR_MODE_GESTURAL_OVERLAY and still has to start at 3-button, because onNavigateNext reads that
field rather than the view state.

setHintRevealed keys off `selection == GESTURAL`, so preselecting 3-button also hides the gesture hint
without a third edit.

---
 .../setupwizard/settings/NavigationSettingsActivity.kt        | 2 +-
 app/src/main/res/layout/setup_navigation.xml                  | 4 ++--
 2 files changed, 3 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/app/src/main/java/org/lineageos/setupwizard/settings/NavigationSettingsActivity.kt b/app/src/main/java/org/lineageos/setupwizard/settings/NavigationSettingsActivity.kt
index d106643..5ff31f5 100644
--- a/app/src/main/java/org/lineageos/setupwizard/settings/NavigationSettingsActivity.kt
+++ b/app/src/main/java/org/lineageos/setupwizard/settings/NavigationSettingsActivity.kt
@@ -26,7 +26,7 @@ import org.lineageos.setupwizard.util.updateCheckedIcons
 
 class NavigationSettingsActivity : BaseSetupWizardActivity() {
 
-    private var selection: String = NAV_BAR_MODE_GESTURAL_OVERLAY
+    private var selection: String = NAV_BAR_MODE_3BUTTON_OVERLAY
 
     private lateinit var hideGesturalHint: MaterialSwitch
     private lateinit var hideGesturalHintCard: View
diff --git a/app/src/main/res/layout/setup_navigation.xml b/app/src/main/res/layout/setup_navigation.xml
index 65b148b..ba8fa01 100644
--- a/app/src/main/res/layout/setup_navigation.xml
+++ b/app/src/main/res/layout/setup_navigation.xml
@@ -34,7 +34,7 @@
                 android:scaleType="fitCenter"
                 app:lottie_autoPlay="true"
                 app:lottie_loop="true"
-                app:lottie_rawRes="@raw/lottie_system_nav_fully_gestural" />
+                app:lottie_rawRes="@raw/lottie_system_nav_3_button" />
 
         </FrameLayout>
 
@@ -44,7 +44,7 @@
             android:layout_width="match_parent"
             android:layout_height="wrap_content"
             android:layout_marginTop="@dimen/control_card_margin_top"
-            app:checkedButton="@+id/mode_gesture"
+            app:checkedButton="@+id/mode_sw_keys"
             app:selectionRequired="true"
             app:singleSelection="true">
 
